#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md:4
msgid "title: Live Recording"
msgstr "title: Registrazione Live"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md:7
msgid "To start a live recording:"
msgstr "Per avviare una registrazione live:"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md:9
msgid "Select a recording task, language, quality, and microphone."
msgstr "Selezionare un task di registrazione, la lingua, la qualità e il microfono."

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md:10
msgid "Click Record."
msgstr "Cliccare su Record."

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md:12
msgid ""
"**Note:** Transcribing audio using the default Whisper model is resource-"
"intensive. Consider using the Whisper.cpp. It supports GPU acceleration, "
"if the model fits in GPU memory. Use smaller models for real-time "
"performance."
msgstr "**Nota:** La trascrizione audio utilizzando il modello Whisper predefinito richiede molte risorse. Valutare l'utilizzo di Whisper.cpp. Supporta l'accelerazione GPU, se il modello si adatta alla memoria della GPU. Utilizzare modelli più piccoli per prestazioni in tempo reale."

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md
msgid "Task"
msgstr "Task"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md
msgid "\"Transcribe\", \"Translate to English\""
msgstr "\"Transcribe\", \"Translate to English\""

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md
msgid "\"Transcribe\""
msgstr "\"Transcribe\""

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md
msgid ""
"\"Transcribe\" converts the input audio into text in the selected "
"language, while \"Translate to English\" converts it into text in "
"English."
msgstr "\"Transcribe\" converte l'audio in input in testo nella lingua selezionata, mentre \"Translate to English\" lo converte in testo in inglese."

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Language"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/2_live_recording.md
