"Open Audio MIDI Setup from Spotlight or from "
"`/Applications/Utilities/Audio Midi Setup.app`."
msgstr "Aprire Audio MIDI Setup da Spotlight o da Spotlight o da `/Applications/Utilities/Audio Midi Setup.app`."

