msgstr "**Funzione**: Scorre automaticamente fino al testo in riproduzione"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:54
msgid "**Shortcut**: `Ctrl+G` (Windows/Linux) or `Cmd+G` (macOS)"
msgstr "**Shortcut**: `Ctrl+G` (Windows/Linux) o `Cmd+G` (macOS)"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:55
msgid "**Usage**: Click to jump to the current audio position in the transcript"
msgstr "**Utilizzo**: Cliccare per passare alla posizione audio corrente nella trascrizione"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:57
msgid "Search Functionality"
msgstr "Funzionalità di Ricerca"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:60
msgid "Search Bar"
msgstr "Barra Search"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:61
msgid "The search bar appears below the toolbar when activated and provides:"
msgstr "La barra di ricerca appare sotto la toolbar quando attivata e fornisce:"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:63
msgid ""
"**Search Input**: Type text to find in the transcription (wider input "
"field for better usability)"
msgstr "**Search Input**: Digitare il testo da trovare nella trascrizione (campo di input più ampio per una migliore usabilità)"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:64
msgid "**Navigation**: Up/down arrows to move between matches"
msgstr "**Navigazione**: Frecce su/giù per spostarsi tra le corrispondenze"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:65
msgid ""
"**Status**: Shows current match position and total matches (e.g., \"3 of "
"15 matches\")"
msgstr "**Status**: Mostra la posizione della corrispondenza corrente e il numero totale di corrispondenze (ad esempio, \"3 of 15 matches\")"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:66
msgid ""
"**Clear**: Remove search text and results (larger button for better "
"accessibility)"
msgstr "**Clear**: Rimuove il testo e i risultati della ricerca (pulsante più grande per una migliore accessibilità)"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:67
msgid "**Results**: Displays found text with context"
msgstr "**Results**: Mostra il testo trovato con il contesto"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:68
msgid ""
"**Consistent Button Sizing**: All navigation buttons have uniform height "
"for better visual consistency"
msgstr "**Consistent Button Sizing**: Tutti i pulsanti di navigazione hanno un'altezza uniforme per una migliore coerenza visiva"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:70
msgid "Search Shortcuts"
msgstr "Scorciatoie di Ricerca"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:71
msgid "**`Ctrl+F` / `Cmd+F`**: Toggle search bar on/off"
msgstr "**`Ctrl+F` / `Cmd+F`**: Attiva/disattiva la barra di ricerca"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:72
#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:127
msgid "**`Enter`**: Find next match"
msgstr "**`Enter`**: Trova la corrispondenza successiva"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:73
#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:128
msgid "**`Shift+Enter`**: Find previous match"
msgstr "**`Shift+Enter`**: Trova la corrispondenza precedente"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:74
#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:129
msgid "**`Escape`**: Close search bar"
msgstr "**`Escape`**: Chiude la barra di ricerca"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:76
msgid "Search Features"
msgstr "Funzionalità della Ricerca"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:77
msgid "**Real-time Search**: Results update as you type"
msgstr "**Real-time Search**: I risultati si aggiornano durante la digitazione"

#: ../../Buzz_Sphinx/source/docs/docs/usage/5_transcription_viewer.md:78
